49 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 250 0 R
/E (Participants explore how Machine Learning works by training a micro:bit to recognize motion. They start with programming the Micro:bit and then collect accelerometer data to train a model to distinguish custom movements. They test their model to catch errors and use the trained data to code interactive games on the Micro:bit)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
